{"id":"about","descriptionEn":"\u003cp\u003eSTUDIO DPi \u003cstrong\u003e是一家位于上海的视觉设计工作室 —— \u003c/strong\u003eDesign For Per \u003ci\u003eissue\u003c/i\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e，专注于为每个问题提供适度有效且灵活的视觉解法。工作室与不同领域的商业客户、艺术家、策展人、 编辑、建筑师保持合作， 设计和实践艺术指导、视觉识别、印刷品、 包装设计、网站等。\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSTUDIO DPi is a visual design practice based in Shanghai. DPi, which stands for “Design for Per \u003ci\u003eissue \u003c/i\u003e”, provides effective and flexible design solutions for each issue. They work on art directions, visual identities, and packaging with clients from diverse fields, and also engage in ongoing collaboration with artists, curators, architects, editors, and institutions, practicing printed matters, web design, and exhibitions.\u003c/p\u003e","jigsaws":[{"id":13,"nameEn":"CONTACT","mode":"CONTACT","status":1,"content":{"descriptionEn":"\u003cp\u003eEmail: \u003ca href=\"mailto:info@studiodpi.work\"\u003einfo@studiodpi.work\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eInstagram: @studio_dpi_work\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAddress: No.505, East changzhi Road,\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHongkou District, Shanghai\u003c/p\u003e"},"weight":8,"athenaId":"about","createdAt":"2023-09-27T19:38:54.287480384+08:00","updatedAt":"2023-10-27T12:02:03.182777544+08:00"},{"id":6,"nameEn":"ACTIVITIES","mode":"ROWS","status":1,"content":{"rows":[{"year":"2023.12","descriptionEn":"\u003cp\u003eWorld Projection——The 11th China International Poster Biennial, The Roof, Hangzhou\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","id":"LpzfjsXRh9l6aUajdMpO6"},{"year":"2023.10","descriptionEn":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e升维设计\u003c/strong\u003e2023\u003cstrong\u003e,\u003c/strong\u003e Lecture, School of Design CAFA, Beijing\u003c/p\u003e","id":"Hpii5Z5XHFOG31Zd31MF5"},{"year":"2023.08","descriptionEn":"\u003cp\u003eTokyo TDC in Hangzhou, X Space, Hangzhou\u003c/p\u003e","id":"4Yx4DGlI9zSLnzwtY2On9"},{"year":"2023.07","descriptionEn":"Award 360˚ 2022 Exhibition, \npidan Gallery, Sha